What is an AWS Instance?

Instance = the cloud computer that runs your JupyterLab, Python code, and ML programs.

An instance is simply a virtual computer rented from AWS.

Think of it like this:

Your Laptop
├── CPU / Processor
├── RAM / Memory
├── Storage
└── Operating System

        ↓ Same concept in AWS ↓

AWS Instance
├── vCPU
├── RAM
├── Storage
└── Operating System / Environment



=========
